Our asks from the Data Governance team:

Data Catalog Tools (ref: Slide 4, Point 3)

What data catalog tool(s) are you currently using?
What tools are in your roadmap for future implementation?
What are the integration capabilities of these tools?


Ontology Integration

What is your current perspective on the role of ontology in data governance?
Have you explored ontology-based approaches for improving data discovery and semantic understanding?
Would you be open to discussing how ontology could enhance your data catalog capabilities?



Our recommendation: Consider incorporating ontology into your future data governance roadmap.
